			},
			"date": "2024-08-01T19:28:22.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Have you looked at serverless framework? <a href=\"https://www.serverless.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"\">serverless.com/</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p><p>Really handy.</p><p>Unless by 'directly to lamdba' you don't want a middleman... In which case ignore this.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "112888431344169500",
			"parentId": "112888414370692900",
